{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"australia-income-tax UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"australia-income-tax.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["australia-income-tax.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Las tasas que se muestran se aplican solo al año de ingresos australiano ZXQPH0000QXZ–ZXQPH0001QXZ (ZXQPH0002QXZ julio ZXQPH0003QXZ a ZXQPH0004QXZ junio ZXQPH0005QXZ). Se excluyen los gravámenes y recargos de Medicare, deducciones, compensaciones, reembolsos de HELP, retenciones, ingresos especiales y casos complejos de residencia. Confirme sus circunstancias con la Oficina de Impuestos de Australia. La calculadora se desactiva después de que finalice el año fiscal hasta que se revisen sus tasas.","record_id":"ca9a012b1cb85597f8a210056537ebf661bd961a545802a6856f8ec939a4008f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":4.760172608874996,"source":"Rates shown apply only to the 2026–27 Australian income year (1 July 2026 to 30 June 2027). Medicare levy and surcharge, deductions, offsets, HELP repayments, withholding, special income and complex residency cases are excluded. Confirm your circumstances with the Australian Taxation Office. The calculator disables itself after the tax year ends until its rates are reviewed.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"6243e8903639051f88bfc5faac03424e026ff2ff01847fbafb25d2a42caa0f27","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Las tasas que se muestran se aplican solo al año de ingresos australiano 2026–27 (1 julio 2026 a 30 junio 2027). Se excluyen los gravámenes y recargos de Medicare, deducciones, compensaciones, reembolsos de HELP, retenciones, ingresos especiales y casos comp